.claude/
# …except the skills, which are documentation. The free-models skill carries
# what three days of being wrong taught us — which signals lie, the four tests
# a new provider has to pass, when the check is even conclusive — and none of
# it was backed up or shared, because it lived under an ignored directory.
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/skills/**
.superpowers/
skills-lock.json

